 "validity": "<b>Terms:</b> All prices are valid for 24 hours after quotation submission. Price is based on 2&ndash;3 persons per room. RM500 deposit per person (RM1,000 for Istanbul&ndash;Cappadocia); full payment must be made 45 days prior to arrival. Private transportation &amp; driving guide is based on a 10&ndash;11 hour basis; extra hours are chargeable. Final itinerary and hotel arrangements will be confirmed 14 days before the trip. Itinerary, price and flight schedule are subject to change. Any complimentary activity is non-exchangeable for other activities, vouchers or cash. Package valid for travel until 31 December 2026.",
